{"content": "Based on the provided Python source code, here are the answers to your questions:\n\n1.  **Release Codename:** The release codename mentioned in the comment (specifically in the `__repr__` method of the `_DataclassParams` class) is **LANTERN-JUNIPER-8808**.\n\n2.  **First Class Functionality:** The first class defined in the excerpt is `FrozenInstanceError`, which inherits from `AttributeError` and serves as an exception raised when an attempt is made to modify an attribute on a class marked as \"frozen\" by the `@dataclass` decorator. This error prevents accidental mutations of immutable dataclass instances, enforcing the read-only nature required by `frozen=True`.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "Based", "logprob": -1.5270117081111678, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.5248487747615584}, {"token": "Based", "logprob": -1.5270117081111678}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -1.7614134109920272}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -4.81346495518148}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -5.242206410259605}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -5.444763020367027}, {"token": "Here", "logprob": -7.026922062725426}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -9.104026631206871}, {"token": "Release", "logprob": -9.395463780254723}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -9.707053974956871}, {"token": "2", "logprob": -10.199472264141441}, {"token": "based", "logprob": -10.327915028423668}, {"token": "3", "logprob": -10.391486958355308}, {"token": "No", "logprob": -10.428262547344566}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -10.466430500835777}, {"token": "<think>", "logprob": -10.64161665806234}, {"token": "Yes", "logprob": -10.862704113811851}, {"token": "```", "logprob": -10.9073847092098}, {"token": "Hello", "logprob": -10.999055699200035}, {"token": "What", "logprob": -11.068282917827965}]}, {"token": " on", "logprob": -2.3775017865546033e-07, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " on", "logprob": -2.3775017865546033e-07}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -15.792652367877132}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -17.5525209